Apart from being a physical hardware token, FIDO2 offers the following
additional verification options:
    - a PIN associated with the token
    - user presence confirmation; for example a button on the token
    - user verification; for example a fingerprint scanner on the token

Be aware that your device may not support all of these. Responding yes to a
question below that relates to feature unsupported by your FIDO2 token will have
no effect.
